' A PlantUML file of its own. The preview button in the editor's title bar
' opens a panel showing the diagram under the cursor; this file holds three,
' so the panel also lists them by id to pick from. The Outline view lists
' them too, with what each declares, and each diagram folds from its start
' line.
' Export All Diagrams as SVG writes one file per diagram, named by its id:
' images/checkout.svg and so on, beside this file. Export Diagram as PNG
' writes the one under the cursor.

@startuml(id=checkout)
actor Customer
participant "Web shop" as Shop
participant "Payment service" as Payments

Customer -> Shop : Place order
Shop -> Payments : Charge card
alt card accepted
  Payments --> Shop : Paid
  Shop --> Customer : Order confirmed
else card declined
  Payments --> Shop : Declined
  Shop --> Customer : Try another card
end
@enduml

@startuml(id=orders-model)
class Order {
  +id: string
  +placedAt: Date
  +total(): number
}
class LineItem {
  +quantity: number
}
class Product {
  +name: string
}
Order "1" *-- "*" LineItem
LineItem "*" --> "1" Product
@enduml

